==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration from the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion was first featured on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Milotic|39}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
*This card's {{TCGP|Promo-A}} illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Milotic|70}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*'''Aqua Edge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Kalos Starter Set|Greninja|14}} from the {{TCG|Kalos Starter Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

